oreTokens()) {\n                try {\n                    st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n                } catch (IOException e) {\n                    e.printStackTrace();\n                }\n            }\n            return Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void addEdge(int u, int v, int cost, int cap) {\n        ++ecnt;\n        edges[ecnt] = new Edge(v, cap, cost, head[u]);\n        head[u] = ecnt;\n        ++ecnt;\n        edges[ecnt] = new Edge(u, 0, -cost, head[v]);\n        head[v] = ecnt;\n    }\n\n    static boolean spfa() {\n        Arrays.fill(used, false);\n        Arrays.fill(dist, INF);\n        Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();\n        dist[src] = 0;\n        q.add(src);\n        used[src] = true;\n        while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n            int x = q.poll();\n            used[x] = false;\n            for (int e = head[x]; e != 0; e = edges[e].nxt) {\n                if (edges[e].cap == 0) continue;\n                int y = edges[e].to;\n                if (dist[y] > dist[x] + edges[e].cost) {\n                    dist[y] = dist[x] + edges[e].cost;\n                    if (!used[y]) {\n                        used[y] = true;\n                        q.add(y);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return dist[sink] < INF;\n    }\n\n    static int augment(int x, int flow) {\n        if (x == src) return flow;\n        used[x] = true;\n        int rem = flow;\n        for (int e = head[x]; e != 0; e = edges[e].nxt) {\n            int y = edges[e].to;\n            if (used[y] || edges[e ^ 1].cap == 0) continue;\n            if (dist[x] < dist[y] + edges[e ^ 1].cost) continue;\n            int got = augment(y, Math.min(rem, edges[e ^ 1].cap));\n            if (got > 0) {\n                rem -= got;\n                edges[e ^ 1].cap -= got;\n                edges[e].cap += got;\n                if (rem == 0) break;\n            }\n        }\n        return flow - rem;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        n = in.nextInt();\n        m = in.nextInt();\n        k = in.nextInt();\n        c = in.nextInt();\n        d = in.nextInt();\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= k; ++i) {\n            int p = in.nextInt();\n            people[p]++;\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= k + m + 2; ++j) {\n                id[i][j] = ++nodeCnt;\n                if (i == 1) {\n                    addEdge(id[i][j], sink, c * (j - 1), INF);\n                }\n                if (j > 1) {\n                    addEdge(id[i][j - 1], id[i][j], 0, INF);\n                }\n            }\n            if (people[i] > 0) {\n                addEdge(src, id[i][1], 0, people[i]);\n            }\n        }\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= m; ++i) {\n            int a = in.nextInt();\n            int b = in.nextInt();\n            for (int j = 1; j <= k + m + 1; ++j) {\n                for (int cost = 1; cost <= 2 * k - 1; cost += 2) {\n                    addEdge(id[a][j], id[b][j + 1], cost * d, 1);\n                    addEdge(id[b][j], id[a][j + 1], cost * d, 1);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        int sent = 0;\n        while (spfa()) {\n            int add;\n            do {\n                Arrays.fill(used, false);\n                add = augment(sink, INF);\n                sent += add;\n                answer += dist[sink] * add;\n            } while (add > 0);\n        }\n\n        // assert sent == k;\n        System.out.println(answer);\n    }\n}\n```", "token_logprobs": [-0.38875481486320496, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -0.00016258825780823827, -2.825220326485578e-05, 0.0, -0.06196761503815651, -0.31329214572906494, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.000291662581730634, -0.0005620330339297652, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.00056429672986269, -0.02329517900943756, -0.0002628219372127205, -0.022670617327094078, -0.38695821166038513, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.4305